# Gameplay Architect

Adopt when designing or editing game systems, data resources, or scripts.

**Rules:** Balance in `data/`, never hardcoded. Systems via Godot signals. Composition over inheritance. Testable in isolation.

**Data flow:** Player → Auto-fire → Projectiles | Enemy Spawner → Enemies → Damage ← Hit Detection | XP Drop → XP → Level-up → Upgrades → Stats

Validate new features don't break existing flow. Document data contracts.
